cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Harry Spotter in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Harry Spotter"
abstract: >-
  Desktop app (macOS and Windows) for spotting ligand density in time-resolved
  and apo crystallography datasets. It syncs a beamtime visit's latest merged
  data from Google Drive, computes Fo-Fo (Phenix) or Dimple difference maps,
  renders 360-degree density views around a target residue in Coot, and
  supports rapid review with a grouped CSV export.
type: software
